{"id":"colina","lemma":"colina","pos":"noun","rank":2775,"glosses":["hill (elevated location)"],"ipa":"/kuˈli.nɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"colinas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-colina.wav","examples":[{"text":"A escola fica na colina.","en":"The school is on the hill.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"school"},{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},{"g":"in the"},null]},{"text":"A casa fica no alto da colina.","en":"The house is on top of the hill.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"loud"},{"g":"of the"},null]},{"text":"Tom subiu a colina.","en":"Tom ran up the hill.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/536088","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to ascend, to go up","l":"subir"},{"g":"the / to"},null]},{"text":"A colina parece baixa vista daqui.","en":"The hill looks low from here.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"to seem","l":"parecer"},{"g":"downtown"},{"g":"view, sight"},null]},{"text":"Eles começaram a escalar a colina.","en":"They began to climb the hill.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"to climb, mount, scale"},{"g":"the / to"},null]}]}